{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#976","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#976","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#976\",\"parent_revision\":\"44f8f136b30b2d01971fd527d939ad881927cafc925a838c7de0ec17d32db104\",\"root_revision\":\"44f8f136b30b2d01971fd527d939ad881927cafc925a838c7de0ec17d32db104\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nCreate a /dh:dispatch skill in development-harness that combines parallel team dispatch mechanics with delegation quality guidelines.\\n\\nSources to synthesize:\\n1. superpowers dispatching-parallel-agents skill (https://raw.githubusercontent.com/johnpwilkinson/superpowers/3367002498a12c8ef70a118454401082805229b0/skills/dispatching-parallel-agents/SKILL.md) \u2014 TeamCreate pattern, when to parallelize, agent prompt structure, common mistakes\\n2. agent-orchestration:agent-orchestration skill \u2014 delegation template (WHERE/WHAT/WHY), pre-gathering prohibition, verification questions, anti-patterns\\n3. agent-orchestration:how-to-delegate skill \u2014 quick delegation framework\\n\\nThe skill should cover:\\n- When to dispatch parallel work (2+ independent tasks)\\n- How to set up the team (TeamCreate \u2192 TaskCreate \u2192 Agent with team_name)\\n- How to write agent prompts (observations + success criteria, no prescriptions)\\n- How to handle results (review, conflict check, integrate)\\n- Common mistakes from both sources\\n- Real examples\\n\\nKeep it concise \u2014 a single SKILL.md with the essential patterns, not a comprehensive reference. The agent-orchestration skill is the comprehensive reference; this skill is the quick-start for \\\"I need to dispatch parallel work right now.\\\"\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **create /dh:dispatch skill combining parallel team dispatch with delegation quality** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Session 2026-03-21: combining superpowers dispatching-parallel-agents pattern with agent-orchestration delegation quality\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-22\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"733662ac61b33cd96cf36cd03ec7576a3d9ac0ecbc16417f8bc30473611cecb1\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVWXyuA\"}"}